{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Gutter guards are protective covers that fit over or inside your gutters, allowing water to flow through while blocking leaves, pine needles, twigs, and other debris. The technology varies by type, but the goal is the same: keep gutters clear without constant cleaning.</p>

<p>Different guard types work better for different debris. Micro-mesh guards with tiny perforations excel at blocking fine debris like Huntsville's ubiquitous pine needles. Screen guards handle larger oak and maple leaves effectively. Solid covers use surface tension to pull water into the gutter while debris slides off the edge.</p>

<p>For most Huntsville homes — especially those near Monte Sano or in older neighborhoods with mature trees — we recommend micro-mesh guards. They handle both fine and coarse debris, and they're tough enough to withstand the weight of heavy debris accumulation during storms. We'll assess your specific situation and recommend the right solution during your free estimate.</p>
{% endset %}

